ps/2755100/extras/5cc8d76008367b638604691582be065c.mp4?t=1744782032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Different units have different exclusive skills, such as summoning, invincibility, blocking,healing, etc., and various units will form a variety of tactical play methods.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/cac9ae4c4db766a92bf8d353b2cf4e1a.avif?t=1744782032\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/62c79b2310316796e2e81e4aec04f154.poster.avif?t=1744782032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/62c79b2310316796e2e81e4aec04f154.webm?t=1744782032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/62c79b2310316796e2e81e4aec04f154.mp4?t=1744782032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>This game uses UE5 technology to create SCI-FI battlefield<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/c9a14e7ab389c74bdc4ac1dd077a3e3e.avif?t=1744782032\" width=600 height=130 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/e8a4ef9d72c687c59be42854fde863e5.poster.avif?t=1744782032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/e8a4ef9d72c687c59be42854fde863e5.webm?t=1744782032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2755100/extras/e8a4ef9d72c687c59be42854fde863e5.mp4?t=1744782032\" 